▶ Description
Official music video for Don't Let Me Be Misunderstood by The Animals from the 1965 album Animal Tracks, upscaled to 4K using Deep Learning and Artificial Intelligence.

▶ Contact & Donation
➡ Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/aivideoworks
➡ Twitter: https://twitter.com/aivideoworks
➡ Reddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/AIVideoworks

▶ Technical Details
➡ Source: Retail Region 2 DVD (25.000 fps)
➡ Source Resolution: 690*334
➡ AI Resolution: 3840*1600
➡ Time taken: ~50+ hours
➡ Audio: LPCM

Please note: '4K' is the definition the video's available at; it doesn't mean the details will be there for all 4K videos. 

